# Reconstructed 2026-10-02 from the live site's observed routing (the deployed
# _redirects is config, not a served file, so it cannot be fetched back).
# Verified against production: / 301s to /formation/, /formation/<file> serves
# that file, /formation/<unknown> 404s, and any other path falls back to the app
# so Supabase magic-link redirects survive URL mangling by in-app browsers.
/formation/*   /:splat        200
/              /formation/    301
/*             /index.html    200
